## ⚠️ Common Errors

| Error | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `Connection refused` | Node not running, or wrong IP/port |
| `File not found` | Use the **Upload ID**, not the filename |
| `Timeout` | Disable Windows Firewall temporarily |
| `Decryption failed` | Never delete `encryption.key` |
